  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNICEF Basic Education 2013-15 - UNICEF Basic Education 2013</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNICEF Basic Education 2013-15</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">BEGE-projektet omfattar 14 provinser i Afghanistan. Programmet fokuserar p&#xe5; f&#xf6;ljande: 
i) distrbitution av l&#xe4;romedel
ii) driva byskolor
iii) tillhandah&#xe5;lla utbildningsm&#xf6;jligheter f&#xf6;r ton&#xe5;ringar
iv) utveckling  av en skolmodell som inkorporerar fr&#xe5;gor om barns skydd och f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ndrad pedagogik
v) alfabetiseringsinsatser f&#xf6;r kvinnor 15-45 &#xe5;r. 

St&#xf6;det &#xe4;r ett projektst&#xf6;d och utg&#xf6;r forts&#xe4;ttning p&#xe5; tidigare BEGE-st&#xf6;d.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The BEGE-project to be supported by Sweden is focusing on 14 provinces in Afghanistan. The project is focusing on the following: 
i) distribution of teaching and learning materials
ii) community based education
iii) accelerated learning centers for youth
iv) child friendly schooling
v) literacy for women 15-45 years old. 

The support is a project support and it&apos;s a continuation of a previous support to BEGE in Afghanistan.</narrative>
  </description>
